{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>ויעמדהו</b> — Two times in the Masorah: here and the other: ויעמדהו לפני אלעזר הכהן. And both are defective, because Jacob was old and needed to be supported so he could stand, and also Joshua was ashamed that he was made leader before Moses, and feared Moses lest he punish him, and needed to be supported. Therefore defective, for their standing was not complete."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 47, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:18:29.523347469Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}